<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Softline declares maiden year results.</title>
<headline>Softline declares maiden year results.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     4.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   7.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   10.37</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.75</p>
<p>    Finance charges	 0.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		  172.00</p>
<p>Full name: Softline Ltd (electronics and electrical)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was well placed to take advantage of the anticipated increase in the growth of information technology in the country. Earnings per share for the year to February 1998 were expected to be in the region of 8.0 cents.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
